title: Hold the Party Together
subtitle: Whatever happens this week, the party must survive it.
view-if: crisis = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= Hold the Party Together

Couriers run between the Zentrale and the districts day and night. Nobody sleeps. Some things have to be done whatever happens on the streets.

- @funds: Collect what money we can.
- @steady: Steady the districts.
- @agitate: Flood the factories with leaflets.

@funds
subtitle: +1 fund.
view-if: resources < 3
on-arrival: resources += 1

The collection tins come back fuller than expected.

@steady
subtitle: Raises Unity; the loudest voices calm down a little.
on-arrival: unity += 4; militancy -= 2

The Zentrale's couriers reach every district with the same message: no adventures, no desertions.

@agitate
subtitle: Worker support and our position in the crisis improve slightly.
on-arrival: worker_support += 1; crisis_momentum += 3

By morning, every factory gate in the city has our leaflet.
